    rdf:value """liked, but I have no vitality to spare to make new friends I care about. And then the gulf that separates a German -! You think they are delicate and refined and sensitive (like OH), and so they are in some respects - and then they are capable of throwing it all overboard and  wallowing . We others make at any rate a faint endeavour not to be pigs  any where, but Germans, as Bernhard says, do not seem to feel any “responsibility toward small things”- 
---
I am tired in heart - I can’t keep a feeling of almost wickedness at letting the children become Catholics. """^^xsd:string ;
